## **b) Write an algorithm using stack (ANY ONE)**

### **i) Algorithm to check well-formed parentheses**
```
Algorithm CheckParentheses(expr):
    Initialize empty stack S
    For each char c in expr:
        If c is '(' or '{' or '[':
            Push c onto S
        Else if c is ')' or '}' or ']':
            If S is empty: return "Not Well-formed"
            top = Pop S
            If (c and top are not matching pair):
                return "Not Well-formed"
    End For
    If S is empty: return "Well-formed"
    Else: return "Not Well-formed"
```

✔ Simple. ✔ Standard. ✔ Full marks material.

